  "question": {
    "text": "Let \\(\\left|z_1-8-2 i\\right| \\leq 1\\) and \\(\\left|z_2-2+6 i\\right| \\leq 2, z_1, z_2 \\in \\mathbf{C}\\). Then the minimum value of \\(\\left|z_1-z_2\\right|\\) is :",
