    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/evG9zTEPo_zozWYLLHXKVUkGSnK9sZf_AhSVtZJcMoY.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\n\n\n\n$\\begin{aligned} & \\because \\mathrm{AB}=\\sqrt{100}=10 \\\\ & \\therefore\\left|\\mathrm{Z}_1-\\mathrm{Z}_2\\right|_{\\min }=10-2-1=7\\end{aligned}$",
